---
/**
 * The crawl from Work 04 into the Research desk (see crawl.ts): one fixed
 * canvas, one pixel per 4px cell, scaled up with hard edges. Above the Work
 * scene, under the index bar (z 50). Only drawn on wide screens with motion on.
 */
---

<canvas class="crawl-layer" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>

<style>
  .crawl-layer {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    z-index: 30;
    image-rendering: pixelated;
    pointer-events: none;
    visibility: hidden;
  }
</style>
